  "extractionNotes": "Self-employed mother, title 0510 from 2024-02-01 (sickness insurance shown in the title type), a new 0510 period and a maternity-benefit title from the birth date. Dedicated hospital certificate for supplementary leave: completed week 36, 3100 g, in hospital 2025-11-27..2025-12-04 (8 days), hospitalisation finished. First ZAM (dated 2025-12-09) claimed the whole 52 weeks as maternity leave; the corrected ZAM (dated 2025-12-19, one day after the 21-day window) split it into maternity 140 days, supplementary 14 days and parental 224 days. Both ZAMs leave the full-length declaration unticked; 81.5% is inferred from the first, in-time application covering 52 weeks, and no rate is asserted. Granted periods printed in a ZUS note. No declared bases in the file, so months are empty. The other parent will not use parental leave."
